      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="1905_AS_RBH_1_00052" />
                  <hi rend="pre-print">Dr. Arthur Schnitzler</hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <hi rend="pre-print">
                     <rs type="place" ref="#pmb168940">Wien XVIII. Spoettelgasse 7</rs>.</hi>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <hi rend="latintype">Dr Richard Beer-Hofma<c rendition="#gemination-n" />,</hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <hi rend="latintype">
                     <rs ref="#pmb173" type="place">Rodaun</rs>
                  </hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <hi rend="latintype">bei <rs ref="#pmb73" type="place">Liesing</rs>
                  </hi>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline rend="right">
                  <pb facs="1905_AS_RBH_1_00053" />
                  <rs ref="#pmb50" type="place">Wien</rs>, <date>30. 7. 905</date>
               </dateline>
               <salute>lieber Richard,</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>ſeit geſtern wieder daheim. Bleibe vorläufig. Das <rs type="work" ref="#pmb29999" subtype="implied">Stück</rs> von <rs ref="#pmb10815" type="person">Bahr</rs> hab
               ich Ihnen ſchicken laſſen.</p>
            <p>Wo ſind Sie? Ist <rs ref="#pmb10860" type="person">Paula</rs>
               <space unit="chars" quantity="1" />ſchon ganz wohl? –</p>
            <closer>Herzlichst, von uns <rs type="person" ref="#pmb2173" subtype="implied">beiden</rs>
               <lb />Ihr<lb />
               <signed>A.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
